    description: "Bare calls to imported functions (Ecto.Query.from, Ecto.Migration.create, ExMachina.build) resolve to ANY project function with the same name. Track import/use directives to build module-level import scope, then gate cross-file resolution on whether the name could come from an import. Plausible-analytics bakeoff shows 82 false migration->Sites.create edges. P3 because local defp resolution is correct; only cross-module unqualified is affected."  # a6cb
